Description: Creates publication-ready traffic-light plots and stacked bar
    charts for risk-of-bias and certainty-of-evidence assessments in
    systematic reviews and meta-analyses. Provides an R interface to the
    Python package 'critiplot' (version 2.1.1 or later) and supports the
    Newcastle-Ottawa Scale (NOS), the Joanna Briggs Institute ('JBI')
    critical appraisal checklists for case reports and case series, the
    GRADE certainty-of-evidence framework, the 'ROBIS' framework for
    systematic reviews, and the Mixed Methods Appraisal Tool ('MMAT').
    Plots are produced by 'critiplot' through the 'reticulate' package.
